    "description": {
      "value": "A cone of icy shards bursts from your spread hands and coats the targets in a layer of frost. You deal 2d4 cold damage to creatures in the area; they must each attempt a Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and takes a \u22125-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 2 rounds.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and takes a \u221210-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 2 rounds."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d4."
    },
